  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing Maternal and Newborn Deaths in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To avert 4000 maternal deaths and 5500 neonatal deaths through nationwide life saving skills training for health professionals, uninterrupted and sustainable clean energy systems, climate resilient water supply and infrastructure, and integrated health system strengthening in selected counties, 2013-2023</narrative>
  </description>
